      "name": "Sarah M.",
      "from": {
        "en": "Dubai, UAE",
        "ar": "دبي، الإمارات",
        "id": "Dubai, UEA"
      },
      "stars": 5,
      "tags": ["batur", "penida", "adv", "nature"],
      "text": {
        "en": "Absolutely worth the 3am start — our guide was brilliant and the sunrise was unreal.",
        "ar": "يستحق الاستيقاظ الساعة 3 فجرًا — كان مرشدنا رائعًا والشروق لا يُصدّق.",
        "id": "Sepadan bangun jam 3 pagi — pemandu hebat dan matahari terbitnya luar biasa."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ahmed K.",
      "from": {
        "en": "Riyadh, KSA",
        "ar": "الرياض، السعودية",
        "id": "Riyadh"
      },
      "stars": 5,
      "tags": ["safari", "waterbom", "family", "kids"],
      "text": {
        "en": "Perfect for the kids — easy day, everything organized, no stress at all.",
        "ar": "مثالي للأطفال — يوم سهل ومنظّم بلا أي توتر.",
        "id": "Sempurna untuk anak — hari mudah, semua teratur, tanpa stres."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Lena R.",
      "from": {
        "en": "Berlin, DE",
        "ar": "برلين، ألمانيا",
        "id": "Berlin"
      },
      "stars": 5,
      "tags": ["sekumpul", "penida", "nature", "adv"],
      "text": {
        "en": "Remote and green and barely anyone there. Felt like a real adventure.",
        "ar": "بعيد وأخضر وبالكاد يوجد أحد. شعرت بمغامرة حقيقية.",
        "id": "Terpencil, hijau, hampir tanpa orang. Terasa petualangan nyata."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Yusuf A.",
      "from": {
        "en": "Jeddah, KSA",
        "ar": "جدة، السعودية",
